DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
18499::$$$message_0142_0000_0000$$$::The sun will set soon.[lr]::
18500::$$$message_0142_0000_0001$$$::It isn't safe to go into the forest after dark, so if I want to go back to the city, I should start making my way back soon.::
18501::$$$message_0142_0001_0000$$$::"Oh, you're leaving? It's already getting late. You should sleep over tonight, Shirou."[lr]::
18502::$$$message_0142_0001_0001$$$::Illya stops me.::
18503::$$$message_0142_0002_0000$$$::"Mistress, consider his circumstances. We shouldn't be unreasonable.[lr]::
18504::$$$message_0142_0002_0001$$$::Master Emiya is a gentleman. While he arrived here without an appointment, he would never be so brazen as to stay the night.[lr]::
18505::$$$message_0142_0002_0002$$$::Isn't that right, Master Emiya?"::
18506::$$$message_0142_0003_0000$$$::"No way. You're not leaving yet, are you, Shirou?[lr]::
18507::$$$message_0142_0003_0001$$$::Won't you sleep over?"::
18508::$$$message_0142_0004_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
18509::$$$message_0142_0004_0001$$$::I'm caught in a crossfire between a gentle gaze and a stone-cold stare.[lr]::
18510::$$$message_0142_0004_0002$$$::Today is the fourth day.[lr]::
18511::$$$message_0142_0004_0003$$$::Saber's waiting for me at home...::
918506::$$$message_9142_0003_0000$$$::"No way. You're not leaving yet, are you, Shirou?"[r]::

